`"$HOME/.demarkus/bin/demarkus-plugin" registry knowledge-list` prints one joined system per line: its MCP server slug, reached through {{.ToolForm}}. {{if eq .Harness "claude"}}Exit 127 (a sandbox, e.g. Cowork): the joined systems are the connected MCP servers that offer `mark_worlds`, one slug each. {{end}}Nothing joined: suggest `/knowledge-join <broker-url>`, stop. {{if eq .Harness "claude"}}Any other non-zero{{else}}Non-zero{{end}} exit or malformed output: surface it, stop; never report an empty registry.